        "original_id": "ad1a5742-a09c-56a2-8232-734eb27198df",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nic Cester, Chris Cester, Cameron Muncey\n- Organizations: Jet\n- Products: Cold Hard Bitch, Rollover DJ, Get Born\n- Topics: music releases, songwriting\n\nFacts:\n- Get Born was released on 14 September 2003 as the debut album by the Australian rock band Jet.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was written by Jet band-members Chris Cester, Nic Cester, and Cameron Muncey.\n- In the United States, Rollover DJ was the third single from Get Born after Cold Hard Bitch, while elsewhere it was the second single.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was released in March 2004.\n- Nic Cester was born on 6 July 1979.\n- Nic Cester is an Australian singer-songwriter and guitarist.\n- Nic Cester is the frontman of Jet alongside his younger brother Chris Cester.",
